; Freeciv: the server alone, headless. Three AI players play five turns on
; a small classic map, saving each turn; -e ends the server with the game.
; The log goes to User/server.log. Run it in the Freeciv drawer.
FailAt 21
Stack 1000000
Date
freeciv-server -e --ruleset classic -r autogame.serv -p 5599 -b 127.0.0.1 -l User/server.log -d n
Echo "freeciv-server returned"
Date
List User/saves
